    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/b16b7a0c6ed3afd0d109734d88df4dfe.poster.avif?t=1755574746\" width=360 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/b16b7a0c6ed3afd0d109734d88df4dfe.webm?t=1755574746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/b16b7a0c6ed3afd0d109734d88df4dfe.mp4?t=1755574746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamba Gun</strong> is the <i>idiotic</i> fusion of <strong>top-down shooter</strong> and <strong>deck building </strong>rogue-likes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS AIN'T NO BABY GAME FOR BABIES! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Gamba Gun</strong>, your weapons are slot machines, and <i>you bet your life</i>. The recipe to success is 100% skill, 100% decision-making, and <i>1000% dumb luck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(That's <strong>1100% More</strong> per 100%!) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >((\u1d1b\u029c\u1d00\u1d1b's <strong>12x</strong> \u1d20\u1d00\u029f\u1d1c\u1d07!)) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/a3fa6daf22ddb73aa22add922864c3f0.poster.avif?t=1755574746\" width=694 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/a3fa6daf22ddb73aa22add922864c3f0.webm?t=1755574746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/a3fa6daf22ddb73aa22add922864c3f0.mp4?t=1755574746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IT'S TWO GUNS, </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield dual revolvers that have the special capacity to fire nonsensical ammunition. <i>Oh yeah</i>, every time you reload them, <i>their ammo magically shuffles.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A BUNCH OF BULLETS, </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with endless ammo combinations, and fill your guns with the best bullets to create powerful synergies! Be careful when choosing, because the bullets in your clip can synergize to destroy enemies, or you... . .. .\u00a0 . .. . .\u00a0 . ..\u00a0 .. . .. .. \u00a0\u00a0 .. .. .\u00a0 . ..\u00a0 .. ..\u00a0 .. . . .\u00a0 . .. \u00a0\u00a0 .. .. .\u00a0 . . ..\u00a0 .. .</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND BAD GUYS TOO. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off a wide cast of colorful cartoon characters that are just as whimsical as they are ornery. Survive the onslaught while the surrounding foes become increasingly absurd. Oh yeah, good luck surviving the bosses, because you'll need it. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(ALSO OTHER STUFF)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new ways to play, gather a library's worth of stuff, then gamble it all away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Features: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RGB:</strong> Gamba Gun uses the RGB Color Model. Wow, that's over <strong>Sixteen-Million*</strong> colors!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*</strong>\u0262\u1d00\u1d0d\u0299\u1d00 \u0262\u1d1c\u0274 \u1d05\u1d0f\u1d07s \u0274\u1d0f\u1d1b \u1d04\u1d0f\u0274\u1d1b\u1d00\u026a\u0274 \u1d1b\u029c\u1d00\u1d1b \u1d0d\u1d00\u0274\u028f \u1d04\u1d0f\u029f\u1d0f\u0280s </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OST:</strong> Gamba Gun has an original soundtrack, so <strong>you basically get an album*</strong> too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*</strong>\u0274\u1d0f\u1d1b \u0274\u1d07\u1d04\u1d07ss\u1d00\u0280\u026a\u029f\u028f \u1d07\u0274\u1d0a\u1d0f\u028f\u1d00\u0299\u029f\u1d07 </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/b16b7a0c6ed3afd0d109734d88df4dfe.poster.avif?t=1755574746\" width=360 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/b16b7a0c6ed3afd0d109734d88df4dfe.webm?t=1755574746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/b16b7a0c6ed3afd0d109734d88df4dfe.mp4?t=1755574746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamba Gun</strong> is the <i>idiotic</i> fusion of <strong>top-down shooter</strong> and <strong>deck building </strong>rogue-likes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS AIN'T NO BABY GAME FOR BABIES! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Gamba Gun</strong>, your weapons are slot machines, and <i>you bet your life</i>. The recipe to success is 100% skill, 100% decision-making, and <i>1000% dumb luck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(That's <strong>1100% More</strong> per 100%!) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >((\u1d1b\u029c\u1d00\u1d1b's <strong>12x</strong> \u1d20\u1d00\u029f\u1d1c\u1d07!)) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/a3fa6daf22ddb73aa22add922864c3f0.poster.avif?t=1755574746\" width=694 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/a3fa6daf22ddb73aa22add922864c3f0.webm?t=1755574746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497930/extras/a3fa6daf22ddb73aa22add922864c3f0.mp4?t=1755574746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IT'S TWO GUNS, </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield dual revolvers that have the special capacity to fire nonsensical ammunition. <i>Oh yeah</i>, every time you reload them, <i>their ammo magically shuffles.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A BUNCH OF BULLETS, </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with endless ammo combinations, and fill your guns with the best bullets to create powerful synergies! Be careful when choosing, because the bullets in your clip can synergize to destroy enemies, or you... . .. .\u00a0 . .. . .\u00a0 . ..\u00a0 .. . .. .. \u00a0\u00a0 .. .. .\u00a0 . ..\u00a0 .. ..\u00a0 .. . . .\u00a0 . .. \u00a0\u00a0 .. .. .\u00a0 . . ..\u00a0 .. .</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND BAD GUYS TOO. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off a wide cast of colorful cartoon characters that are just as whimsical as they are ornery. Survive the onslaught while the surrounding foes become increasingly absurd. Oh yeah, good luck surviving the bosses, because you'll need it. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(ALSO OTHER STUFF)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new ways to play, gather a library's worth of stuff, then gamble it all away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Features: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RGB:</strong> Gamba Gun uses the RGB Color Model. Wow, that's over <strong>Sixteen-Million*</strong> colors!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*</strong>\u0262\u1d00\u1d0d\u0299\u1d00 \u0262\u1d1c\u0274 \u1d05\u1d0f\u1d07s \u0274\u1d0f\u1d1b \u1d04\u1d0f\u0274\u1d1b\u1d00\u026a\u0274 \u1d1b\u029c\u1d00\u1d1b \u1d0d\u1d00\u0274\u028f \u1d04\u1d0f\u029f\u1d0f\u0280s </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OST:</strong> Gamba Gun has an original soundtrack, so <strong>you basically get an album*</strong> too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*</strong>\u0274\u1d0f\u1d1b \u0274\u1d07\u1d04\u1d07ss\u1d00\u0280\u026a\u029f\u028f \u1d07\u0274\u1d0a\u1d0f\u028f\u1d00\u0299\u029f\u1d07 </p>",
    "short_description": "Gamba Gun is the idiotic fusion of top-down shooter and deck building rogue-likes. Experiment with endless ammo combinations, and create powerful synergies to fight against a colorful cast of enemies.",
